msgctxt "title:ipg-app-b"
msgid "Changes from Previous Versions"
msgstr "与之前版本的更动"

#. kind: official-body
#. source-sha256: 46d8d018f0432658322d96bc44243a2d314a36134e0fad80ce2c3d53d9af83f4
msgctxt "block:ipg-app-b-change-01"
msgid "1.2: Removed specific details of how penalties are collected and stored, as it varies depending on the software being used."
msgstr "1.2：由于记录和收集方式因软件而异，故取消此方面的特别说明。"

#. kind: official-body
#. source-sha256: e4aa52be4c93b7576b89038901b1aa663cc8e1a6d0e7f50af28760c954a799ee
msgctxt "block:ipg-app-b-change-02"
msgid "2.1: Treat missed Saga turn actions as missed triggers."
msgstr "2.1：遗忘传纪的回合动作，视为遗漏触发来处理。"

#. kind: official-body
#. source-sha256: 045ea6dc172dd332b0957826e275662938f7ce8cb8fac372ac757efcdf451678
msgctxt "block:ipg-app-b-change-03"
msgid "2.1: Missed triggers still count as having triggered."
msgstr "2.1：被遗漏的触发式异能仍认为已触发过。"

#. kind: official-body
#. source-sha256: fdbd7466fd2af39f3ab412ccc70e822a8eeaeb127b0897621f5ee42c3733b4fa
msgctxt "block:ipg-app-b-change-04"
msgid "2.5: Object-in-wrong-zone changed to always be a partial fix, but only when the incorrect zone is the root GRV."
msgstr "2.5：物件处于错误区域中的情况始终适用于部分修正，但仅当该GRV是由处于错误区域本身导致的。"

#. kind: official-body
#. source-sha256: 256455c0020fbf2ac60600558b120715b83529ba57f4d6dafd436905c65752b9
msgctxt "block:ipg-app-b-change-05"
msgid "3.5: Wrong number of cards upgrade has been split into two paragraphs for clarity, as it has slightly different criteris for pre- and post-sideboard games."
msgstr "3.5：牌张数量错误的升级被分为两段内容，以厘清换备前与换备后对局两种不同情况之判断标准的区别。"
